# Accepted findings. Each one is a deliberate design choice, explained here and in the README.

# Public load balancer: this is an internet-facing web service; tasks and Aurora stay private.
AWS-0053
AVD-AWS-0053

# HTTP listener: it only forwards traffic when no ACM certificate is set (demo mode). With
# certificate_arn set, port 80 redirects to HTTPS on a TLS 1.3 policy.
AWS-0054
AVD-AWS-0054

# Egress 443 to 0.0.0.0/0 from tasks and the ALB-to-task path: tasks reach ECR, Secrets Manager
# and CloudWatch through the NAT gateway. Replace with VPC interface endpoints to remove it,
# at extra hourly cost per endpoint.
AWS-0104
AVD-AWS-0104
